{"id":"n73459-1-8","stage":3,"title":"입장료 · 入场费","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73459-1-8-1","ko":"어른 하나에 아이 둘이면 입장료가 얼마죠?","zh":"一位成人加两个儿童，门票多少钱？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어른","meaning":"成年人，大人","explanation":"어른：成年人，大人。","readings":[{"term":"어른","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72574","senseId":"1","lemma":"어른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어른","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3"}},{"text":"하나에","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나에","audio":"/audio/a64a32540e921d3a7605.mp3"}},{"text":"아이","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}},{"text":"둘이면","meaning":"二","explanation":"둘：二；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘이면","audio":"/audio/fea5df3123db68847cca.mp3"}},{"text":"입장료가","meaning":"入场费，门票","explanation":"입장료：入场费，门票；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"입장료","audio":"/audio/fd9dbea8c89132393308.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73459","senseId":"1","lemma":"입장료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입장료가","audio":"/audio/9b5a5b357f5b1b78e2e9.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마죠?","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","sense